  "contracts": [
    "New profile starts only when the selected original tuple output is produced by an exact scalar Move; every selected output must have that original packed shape.",
    "Follow each immutable earlier SSA Move chain to a scalar Binary(Sub), and its selected target operand to an exact original LoadY/Move chain for that cell. Other isolators, partial tensor producers and mixed producers refuse.",
    "The opposite value must be independent of every target in the complete dense original target range, not only its selected cell.",
    "Full original source shape/bounds and register-flow validation plus immutable unique producer ownership remain mandatory. Every call argument, including unused formals/unused result prefixes, is checked against the whole target tuple.",
    "Retain every original operation before the original stores in order, including unused fault-sensitive prefixes. After that complete prefix, append private checked Move packing and one range store. Original source node/program/output/store identity and span remain in the certificate.",
    "Materialization overflow or empty output values refuse before changing the private operation buffer. No new scalar source owners, per-coordinate kernels, array reassociation or synthesized canonical tensor residual.",
    "Existing TensorBinary certification/emission, v3 atomic-publication/fault ABI, input immutability, unsupported operations and whole-target coupling refusal remain."
  ],
